# =======================================================================
# data/processed/ — Processed Document Chunks & Embeddings
# =======================================================================
# PURPOSE:
# This directory stores local JSON artifacts generated during the Day-2/Day-3
# pipeline (extracted text, parent/child chunks, and 384-dimensional vector
# embeddings).
#
# SENSITIVE DATA & PRIVACY:
# Generated JSON files contain full text extracts of uploaded documents.
# All *.json files here are excluded from Git tracking via .gitignore
# to protect processed student data and maintain a clean repository.
#
# INSTRUCTIONS FOR NEW USERS:
# - No manual file creation is needed here.
# - The backend automatically creates cached JSON files when processing PDFs.
# =======================================================================
